  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_2558.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El front&oacute;n municipal que el Ayuntamiento de Onda tiene en Artesa ha acogido la noche de este mi&eacute;rcoles el certamen festivo de paellas, seguido de dos jugadas de bingo y un mon&oacute;logo de Estele Rodr&iacute;guez, de Castell&oacute; de la Plana.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesartesa14/img_2542.jpg\" alt=\"img_2542\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesartesa14/img_2543.jpg\" alt=\"img_2543\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesartesa14/img_2546.jpg\" alt=\"img_2546\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesartesa14/img_2549.jpg\" alt=\"img_2549\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesartesa14/img_2550.jpg\" alt=\"img_2550\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesartesa14/img_2552.jpg\" alt=\"img_2552\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesartesa14/img_2553.jpg\" alt=\"img_2553\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesartesa14/img_2554.jpg\" alt=\"img_2554\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesnocturnesartesa14/img_2558.jpg\